{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVERYTHING IS SET FOR CHAOS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Thumps and Blows</i></strong> is a 2D fighting game (<i>surprise!</i>) featuring a cast of wild and unique characters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strike hard </strong>or <strong>use your energy</strong> to unleash ridiculous skills and powerful moves.<strong> Beat your friends\u00a0</strong>in crazy 1vs1 battles, or<strong> enjoy the Arcade Mode</strong>\u00a0with a wild story starring Widijou &amp; company.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features\u00a0<strong>easy-to-learn controls</strong>\u00a0with\u00a0<strong>deep gameplay</strong>, so everyone can join the chaos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pro\u00a0tip:</strong>\u00a0The best strategy is to hit and not get hit.\u00a0<i>You\u2019re welcome!</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650210/extras/f270b6e3d2370b9ceeb3daa6ad5126c5.poster.avif?t=1773751605\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650210/extras/f270b6e3d2370b9ceeb3daa6ad5126c5.webm?t=1773751605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650210/extras/f270b6e3d2370b9ceeb3daa6ad5126c5.mp4?t=1773751605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >All styles are welcome!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't be shy-smash your rivals with everything you've got. Then you can start playing<i> Thumps &amp; Blows</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most of the time, you will use\u00a0<strong>basic attacks</strong>\u00a0to deal damage and do\u00a0<strong>combos</strong>. But once you accumulate enough <strong>energy</strong>, you can use some <span class=\"bb_strike\">absurd</span>\u00a0powerful\u00a0<strong>special techniques</strong>! Each character has their own, and <strong>they can be anything</strong>! Jumping like a monkey, firing a fart like a missile, applying sunscreen, performing a really manly counterattack\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also perform<strong> secondary actions</strong>, like dodging, floating in the air, charging a jump\u2026 In exchange for a bit of energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In conclusion, <strong>each character has plenty of tools and tricks</strong>, and <strong>managing your energy properly is the key to victory</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pro tip</strong>: Unplug your opponent's controller without them noticing to gain an advantage. <i>You're welcome!</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650210/extras/7987a7c282e012213d280d21e81d0fb6.poster.avif?t=1773751605\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650210/extras/7987a7c282e012213d280d21e81d0fb6.webm?t=1773751605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650210/extras/7987a7c282e012213d280d21e81d0fb6.mp4?t=1773751605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enjoy the Arcade Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Widijou's Short Films team</strong> makes movies\u2026 that <i>never succeed!</i> To make a living, they take on\u00a0<i>shady works</i> for the mayor and, in return, receive grants from the Stick City council.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's why they don\u2019t hesitate when they are told to free the city from a colourful clone plague\u2026 of themselves! Meanwhile, other well known people from Stick City begin investigating the phenomenon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They have no choice but to fight their way through to discover the mystery: Who\u2019s behind this? And\u2026 why?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650210/extras/bf332edfd05aaef3ac583a6914ab777f.poster.avif?t=1773751605\" width=682 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650210/extras/bf332edfd05aaef3ac583a6914ab777f.webm?t=1773751605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650210/extras/bf332edfd05aaef3ac583a6914ab777f.mp4?t=1773751605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seriously, why? It seems like a really stupid plan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Let's start kicking asses!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In summary:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything is allowed in these crazy fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as 10 unique stickmen (for better or worse)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create wild combos and use absurd techniques</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your friends or enjoy the story mode!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the misfortunes of the Widijou's Short Films team</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel art style (lol) with handmade animations (lmao)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650210/extras/2fe2b71cb8087311a6bea84e8832b0b0.poster.avif?t=1773751605\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650210/extras/2fe2b71cb8087311a6bea84e8832b0b0.webm?t=1773751605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650210/extras/2fe2b71cb8087311a6bea84e8832b0b0.mp4?t=1773751605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Thumps\u00a0&amp;\u00a0Blows\u00a0</i>is at least twice as fun in company. We recommend playing a few matches before choosing a main character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to follow how development is going? Check out the social media and join the <strong>official Discord server</strong> to stay tuned!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game is built in IKEMEN Go, but it originally started as a MUGEN project.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3650210?t=1773751605","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650210/903598f6d14e84b025c701e7171bb0ca7e2c4967/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773751605","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650210/6e5072b4f3a5d781ff53bee200c2b2c85c82ba8c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773751605","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650210/6e5072b4f3a5d781ff53bee200c2b2c85c82ba8c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773751605","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{