bsurd techniques</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your friends or enjoy the story mode!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the misfortunes of the Widijou's Short Films team</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel art style (lol) with handmade animations (lmao)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650210/extras/2fe2b71cb8087311a6bea84e8832b0b0.poster.avif?t=1773751605\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650210/extras/2fe2b71cb8087311a6bea84e8832b0b0.webm?t=1773751605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650210/extras/2fe2b71cb8087311a6bea84e8832b0b0.mp4?t=1773751605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Thumps\u00a0&amp;\u00a0Blows\u00a0</i>is at least twice as fun in company. We recommend playing a few matches before choosing a main character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to follow how development is going? Check out the social media and join the <strong>official Discord server</strong> to stay tuned!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game is built in IKEMEN Go, but it originally started as a MUGEN project.</i></p>","developers":["Widijou"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650210/83f8e115e0c4fcf164a560e4ce4273857a1c10a5/header.jpg?t=1773751605","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3650210/693125025/1d0108e10742f0470ec36ecc84728b4cfd4f8dcc/1750